---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = new Date('2026-05-28');
const formatted = updated.toLocaleDateString('en-US', {
  year: 'numeric',
  month: 'long',
  day: 'numeric',
});
---

<BaseLayout title="Now -- alzr.us" description="What Adam Lazarus is working on this month.">
  <h1>Now</h1>
  <p class="kicker">
    A <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" rel="external">/now page</a>. What I'm actually
    working on this month. Refreshed every few weeks.
  </p>

  <ul class="now-list">
    <li>
      <strong>Day job-</strong> building the playbook for AI-augmented engineering on a small team.
      Less ticket-pushing, more taste.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Advisory engagements-</strong> wrapping a multi-month engineering org assessment
      using a DORA / Westrum / DevEx kit. The findings have been useful enough to publish.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Writing-</strong> first long-form posts in queue: parallel Claude Code agents for hiring
      research, the writing-voice guide for AI assistants, and the vault as a personal automation platform.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Vault-</strong> extending the daily 6 AM pipeline with research-narrative folds and a
      Vercel deploy logger. Personal data infrastructure, paid in mornings.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Reading-</strong> the new wave of agent-orchestration patterns out of Anthropic and
      the Claude Code SDK. Lots to steal.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p class="updated">
    <em>Last updated: <time datetime={updated.toISOString()}>{formatted}</time></em>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 18, 'SOFT' 50, 'WONK' 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .now-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .now-list li {
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .now-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .now-list strong {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 18, 'SOFT' 50, 'WONK' 0;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }

  .updated {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
